window.products.push({"id":84023,"name":"washOTG Mobile Portable Clothes Washer | Lightweight, Easy To Use Clothes Washing Wand Is Great For Camping, Hiking, Road Trips, Students & More | Rap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZJuJmN8eS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"washOTG Portable Washing MachineDo you enjoy going camping and hiking, but never know how to effectively wash your dirty clothes?Are you tired of wasting water on ineffective washing methods that never seem to get your clothes fully clean when traveling?Introducing ?washOTG’s Portable Camping Washer?At washOTG, we know how hard it can be to keep you clothes clean and smelling fresh while you’re out camping, hiking, or just traveling through nature. There are some methods that many try, but those ultimately never end up making your clothes completely clean and just waste precious water. That’s why we’ve come up with our clothes washing wand!This mobile clothes washer is the ultimate camping essential for giving your clothes a deep and thorough wash without wasting excess water and getting your clothes completely spotless. How it works is simple and only takes 3 easy steps:Fill a laundry bucket with waterAdd your preferred detergent and then add your clothes.Place the clothes washing wand onto your clothes and begin pushing up and down continuously until cleanThanks to the grooved interior of the washing nozzle, our mobile hand washer acts just like a real washing machine when you push it up and down continuously onto your clothes. Our portable camping washer is also made from durable material that’s still gentle enough as to not tear or ruin your clothesNeed more reasons to choose us?Measures 26.5 when together and being collapsible into 5 parts makes it easy to pack when travelingErgonomic shovel type handle makes it easy to use without straining yourselfMakes a great gift for your friend or family member who’s always travelingClick the Add to Cart button and start cleaning your clothes the economical and effective way while camping with our Portable Washing Machine, today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZJuJmN8eS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"washOTG","source_asin":"B092XC3CM8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092XC3CM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092XC3CM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
