window.products.push({"id":84072,"name":"20 Pieces Dishwasher Kick Plate Trim Retainer Fastener Plastic Rivets Clips Compatible with Kenmore, Kitchenaid, WPW10503548 Replace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DhX-ECcZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"20 Pieces dishwasher kick plate trim retainer fastener plastic rivets clips compatible with Kenmore, Kitchenaid, WPW10503548 replace  Practical and durable: These plastic dishwasher kick plate screws are practical and durable, wear-resistant and not easy to break, providing you with long-term use.  Provide firm fixation: The dishwasher fasteners are easy and convenient to install, which can help fix the kick plate under dishwasher securely. And there are enough quantity of clips for you to use or replace the broken ones.  Specification: Color: black Quantity: 20 pieces  Package includes: 20 x Dishwasher kick plate trim retainers  Warm note: This is a compatible spare part and any related brand and model designation has been mentioned above is only for purposes of demonstrating compatibility, our trademark is Mudder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DhX-ECcZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mudder","source_asin":"B08C741KNJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C741KNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C741KNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":84073,"name":"County Line Kitchen - Stainless Steel Filter & Infuser for Cold Brew, Iced Coffee, and Iced Tea - Use with 2 Quart Wide Mouth Mason Jars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jGMidp47L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Included - stainless steel filter - silicone seal - instruction manual with recipes. Easy to use - simply pour coarse ground coffee into the filter basket, add water and allow to steep for 24 to 48 hours. Remove the filter basket and discard the grounds and you have 3 cups of delicious coffee concentrate. All components are dishwasher safe. Create Concentrated Brew - our large filter basket allows the highest ratio of coffee grounds to water for any cold brewer. The silicone seal allows you to shake the jar during the brewing process ensuring that all of the grounds are completely wetted. High Quality Materials - the filter is made from heavy gauge, food grade stainless steel wire that will not bend or dent. Other coffee makers use thin, easily damaged stainless steel cloth. Versatile Brewer - the 1 quart jar will yield up to 3 cups of coffee concentrate. Use multiple jars to brew one batch while drinking and storing another. This system can also be used to make hot tea or sun tea with loose leaf teas and infuse water with fruits or oils with spices. Cold Brewing Benefits - cold brewing coffee prevents the formations of acids that create bitterness and obscure the flavors of the coffee. The low acid content of the coffee is also a benefit for reflux sufferers. In addition, the stainless steel filter allows the aromatic oils of the beans that are removed by a paper filter to pass through into the coffee further improving the flavor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jGMidp47L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"County Line Kitchen","source_asin":"B07CL8YV1H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CL8YV1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CL8YV1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
