window.products.push({"id":84098,"name":"[W10248240 Switch OEM Mania] W10248240 NEW OEM Produced for Whirlpool Washer Temperature Sensor Switch 1549115 AH2367043 EA2367043 PS2367043 - PRODUCE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UWqZeMH-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is an OEM product produced on MAY 4, 2021 (21/05/04 marked on the item means Year 2021/ Month May / Day 4. It is produced under strict quality control, and the quality is reliable. GLOBAL Grade Premium Temperature Sensor Switch - Meets or Exceeds OEM Specifications Quality. Comes in new sturdy box packaging Global Solutions USA Washer Temperature Sensor Switch Part Number WPW10248240 replaces 110.298228 110.298328 1CWTW57ESVW1 Compatible With Most Whirlpool Washers including 110.298228 110.298328 1CWTW57ESVW1 MVWC5ESXW0 MVWC6ESWW1 MVWC7ESWW0 WTW57ESVH1 WTW57ESVW1 WTW58ESVW1 Compatible with Whirlpool Jenn-Air Amana Magic Chef Admiral Norge Roper and others Please refer to the video for more information on the product and how to replace it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UWqZeMH-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OEM MANIA WE CARE YOUR DIFFICULTY.","source_asin":"B096TKLJVQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096TKLJVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B096TKLJVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":84099,"name":"Upgrade 205613 WP358276 Washer Water Inlet Valve by Beaquicy - Compatible with Maytag Whirlpool Kenmore Washer - Replace AP4023852 PS1583805 EAP158380","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pB6gQLlDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【205613 WASHER INLET VALVE】: The 205613 water inlet valve is a universal water inlet valve for washing machines. The valve has a universal 3/8\" spout and a 1/2\" rubber adaptor conversion spout. The water valve is used to control whether water can enter the washing machine and the amount of water that enters the machine. ►The water valve is rated at 110-120V, 50/60Hz. The package includes 1 x 205613 Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve. The updated version has been upgraded in materials to make the valve less prone to damage, rust, cracks and leaks, extending the life of the valve and running smoother and quieter. ✅【ABS PLASTIC AND STAINLESS STEEL METAL MATERIAL】: The 205613 Maytag Washer Water Valve is made of high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel metal materials for excellent durability and firmness.The high quality plastic material makes the water valve less likely to break during transport due to violent transportation and less likely to be damaged during use or to leak from the joints. The high quality stainless steel metal makes the water valve less susceptible to water vapour in the washing machine, preventing the valve from rusting and failing to maintain its water inlet function. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】: The 205613 Washer Water Inlet Valve support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ►This water valve controls the flow of water into the washing machine while effectively filtering out impurities from the water, making the water entering the washing machine cleaner. When the valve is in inlet operation, it runs quietly and smoothly and does not show intermittent inlet. If valve is broken, the washer will have the following conditions, and the inlet valve need to be replaced in time: The washing machine does not feed water. Small amount of water entering the washing machine. Leakage at washing machine water valve. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY BRANDS】: The 205613 Washer Inlet Valve can replacement for Maytag, Kenmore, Whirlpool and other brands washer.►Replaces: AP4023852, 25832, 2-3177, 2-3847, 2-4028, 203177, 203847, 204028, etc.►Compatible: 1985816100, 1985816150, 1985816151, 1985816152, 1985816153, 1985816200, 1985818100, 1985818101, 1985818150, 1985818151, 1985818200, 1985818201, DA6221, DA9000, DA9041, DA9043, DA9101, DA9103, FA3590, FA3591, FA3690, FA3691, FA3820, FA3821, FA4100, FA4101, FA4110, LAT9200AAM, LAT9200AAW, LAT9200ABL, LAT9200ABW, LAT9200BAE, LAT9200BAL, LAT9200BAM, LAT9200BAW, LAT9200BBE, GA608, GA608S, HA106, LA608, LA608S, LAT1910AAW, LAT5000AAW, LSE7800ADL, LSE7800ADW, LA7800, A9800, etc. ✅【BRING CONVENIENCE FOR YOUR LIFE】: The installation of the 205613 washer drain pump is simple. You need is a pair of work gloves and some simple basic tools. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. Empty the contents of the washing machine. Locate the water valve near the water inlet. Disconnect the device connected to the water valve and remove the broken water valve from the washing machine. Connect the new water valve to the water pipe, the electrical cord and secure the water valve in the washing machine with screws. You can save the cost of replacing the washing machine or hiring a repairman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pB6gQLlDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083HV65MZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083HV65MZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083HV65MZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
