window.products.push({"id":84226,"name":"Beaquicy 74010750 Oven Bake Element - Replacement for Ken-more Oven - Replaces 1184162, AP6011209, PS11744404, EAP11744404","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617-Ae7Y4iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】--- 74010750 Bake element is at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking. The size is approximately width 15-3/8 inches X length 23-5/8 inches and has 3-3/8\" inserts. The space from the front to the mounting bracket is 15 3/8\". The space from the mounting bracket to the end of terminal is 3 3/8\". The rod is bent slightly down. The rated power is 2585 watts and the voltage is 240 volts. The package includes 1×74010750 Oven Bake Element. ✅【HIGH QUALITY】--- 74010750 Oven Bake Element is made of high temperature resistant nickel stainless steel alloy, which are used rated for good strength and oxidation resistant at continuous high temperatures. This material can be used for a long time.Well-tested by manufacturer, non OEM but quality equal to OEM requirements, long service life. If the following conditions occur, replace in time: ① Little to no heat when baking; ②Element will not heat; ③Oven not heating evenly; ④Will Not Start. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】--- 74010750 Oven Bake Element can compatible with Ken-more, May-tag, Sam-sung Ad-miral Oven. ►Replaces Part Numbers: 1184162, AP6011209, PS11744404, EAP11744404, JES8850AAW, MER4351AAB, MER4351AAQ, MER4351AAW, MER4351AGW, MER5770AAA, 62946796, JER8850AAA, JER8850AAB, JER8850AAQ, JER8850AAW, JER8850ACB, JER8850ACW, JER8850BAB, JER8850BAQ, AER1350BAT, AER1450AAH, AER1450BAH, AER2350AMH, AER4111AAW, AER4311AAW, AER5511AAB, AER5511AAQ, AER5511AAW, AER5511ACB, AER5511ACW, etc. ✅【AFTER-SALES SERVICE】--- The 74010750 Oven Bake Element supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. We are committed to allowing our customers to use the highest quality products at the best prices. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】--- Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before repairing 74010750 Oven Bake Element. Helpful tools includes: a phillips screwdriver and a pair of work gloves. You need to removed the screws inside the oven which were holding the element in place. Unclipped the old element from the wires, clipped the new element onto the wires, reattached the screws securing the new element in place. You can follow the Youtube videos if you have trouble installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617-Ae7Y4iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087M1WTTL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087M1WTTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087M1WTTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
