window.products.push({"id":84237,"name":"Weceleh Countertop Dishwasher, Portable Dishwasher 6.8L Capacity with 7 Programs, 360° Spray, 140-160℉ Hot Air Drying Function, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XnXyuWQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Flip Top & Anti-Leakage Design ]: Compared with other side opening dishwashers of other brands, Weceleh countertop dishwasher adopt flip top design and integrated production technology with seamless internal structure. Therefore, there is no need to worry about water leakage during the washing process or taking out the tablewares. [More Scientific Installation ]: Weceleh Flip Top dishwasher is equipped with a faucet diverter set which won't affect the normal use of the kitchen faucet. 2 methods installation are supported, suitable for the most faucets. More scientific installation can ensure a clean water source for cleaning tableware. You can follow up the installation instructions, if you encounter any problems, just contact us, the Weceleh customer service team will provide comprehensive help in time. [ Compact Design but Large Capacity ]: Weceleh compact dishwasher can wash 30+ items, it can contain : plate*4, deep dish*3, cup*3, glass cup*3, small bowl*4, fork*4, spoon*4, table knife*4 ( just suggest the configuration. You can match it freely according to your own needs). At the same time, Weceleh dishwasher is made in a compact design: 16.9\" x 16.5\" x 16.9\" (W×D×H) | Weight: 25.35 lbs | Noise level: 55dB. [ 10 Scene Programs ]:Weceleh multifunctional dishwasher includes: FRUIT, MEAT, NORMAIL, INTENSEIVE, RAPID, ECHO, HYGIENE, SANITIZE, LIGHT, PRE-RINSE 10 programs to meet your needs in different usage scenarios. An extra STORE mode offers you 72h ventilated storage to prevent odors and keep your dishes clean (when the mode on, it will consume power, you can turn this mode on or off manually). [ Specific Fruit Wash ]: Weceleh dishwasher contains a fruit basket so fruit and vegetables can be cleaned, ready to serve directly from the dishwasher. Via the fruit mode, you can soak fruits to clean the fruits thoroughly. [ Safe & Carefree Operation ]: Weceleh safe dishwasher contains easy touch control and Intuitive LED Digital Display. Child Lock and Leak Protection offer you a safe and carefree experience. Equiped with the transparent big glass window, you can observe the real-time running state of the machine. [ Save Water & Energy ]: Weceleh ECO dishwasher can clean dishes with less water and energy. It only consumes 3.8-8L water per wash (normal washing programs, 15L needed in fruit & meat mode), only 1/3 to 1/2 water needed comparing to the handwashing or other brand dishwashers, at the same time it only cosumes 0.35 kilowatt-hours per year which makes the Weceleh dishwasher be a eco friendly machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XnXyuWQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weceleh","source_asin":"B0B4CQQ7KT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4CQQ7KT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4CQQ7KT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
