window.products.push({"id":84284,"name":"Nugget Ice Maker, Cohotek Ice Maker Machine for Countertop, 9 Bullet Cubes Ready in 6 Mins, 33 lbs/24H, Portable Ice Maker Machine with Scoop, Basket ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IxKwRaMeL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍨🧊Fast & Low-noise Ice Making - The environmentally-friendly, low-noise machine boasts a high-power compressor for fast ice making, producing nine nice and clear ice cubes within six to eight minutes and a total of 33 pounds of ice per day. The noise level is less than 45db and won't disturb you for anytime. It does all this despite operating at only 130 watts, which should save significantly on electricity. 🍨🧊Two Size Bullet Shape Optional - Small and large size fitting all of your cocktail-making needs, the bullet shape is perfect for mixed beverages and small water bottle openings, and the bullet shape ice won't agglomerate together to form larger clusters. There are a removable basket and an included BPA-free plastic ice scoop for easy, hassle-free ice retrieval. We also offer a stainless steel cup to put the ice. 🍨🧊Infrared Sensor & Simple Operation - With an easy-to-use control panel, kids will also can operate ice-making production. The large clear window that lets you view the progress of ice making without opening it. An underside drain plug which makes it quick to drain remaining water. With advanced infrared sensor technology, the indicator light will come on to remind you when the ice basket is full or need to add water, no leakage. 🍨🧊Durable and Compact - The ice maker machine with a dimension of 14.09 x 9.52 x12.91in, which is small enough for most countertops and easy to carry with. To prevent dust and other particles from getting into the ice, there are a mesh filter located on the bottom of the reservoir which helps keep the machine clean and running efficiently. But we still recommend that you clean it routinely. 🍨🧊One More Thing - Cohotek ice maker comes with a removable ice basket, an ice scoop, a stainless steel cup, easily transfer the ice cubes from ice maker machine. We provides 1 year and 30 days return policy. Perfect for kitchen countertop, backyards, RV, restaurants, boats and more. Note: In order to make the ice cubes more crystal clear, we recommend that you use distilled water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IxKwRaMeL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cohotek","source_asin":"B08QV7L5HT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QV7L5HT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QV7L5HT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
