window.products.push({"id":84406,"name":"R.W.FLAME Countertop Ice Makers Machine - 26LBS/24H Ice Cube Maker Portable Self Cleaning Ice Machine,2 Ice Sizes S/L (Classic Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X1WUK5wKL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Self Cleaning Ice Maker】The countertop ice maker is made of food-grade material, built-in self-cleaning program, you can use the self-cleaning function by pressing the \"ON/OFF\" button for more than 5S, the ice machine can be cleaned automatically, very easy to clean, save your time, what is more, it can produce pure health ice cubes, you can enjoy the good pure ice anytime you want it 【Power & Ice Full & Water Shortage Indicator】The ice maker machine comes with indicators; when connected with the power cord and get the power, the POWER indicator is on; when the water shortage, the \"ADD WATER\" indicator is on and remind you to add water; when the ice full, the ICE FULL indicator is on and remind you to enjoy the cool ice cube with your family or friends 【2 Sizes of Ice Cubes】The size of the portable ice maker is 13.9\"(D)*9.5\"(W)*13(H)\", you can put it on the countertop at your home, kitchen or office; The nugget ice maker can produce SMALL / LARGE two sizes of the ice cubes, you can select the ice cubes for different wines, water, beverage, coffee, and food 【Easy to Operate & fully Open Design】The crunch ice maker machine comes with a user manual, very easy to use, just three steps to produce the ice: pour the water into the water tank, press the \"ON/OFF\" button, and select the size of ice cube you need, after 6-8 minutes, the 9 ice cubes are ready; The fully open design make the ice makers easier to clean 【Effiency & Quiet】The ice machines countertop can produce 26LBS popular bullet-shaped ice per day, you can use it in the kitchen, home, office, outdoor parties; Large transparent window for easy internal observation; This ice maker countertop is equipped with a quick and quiet cooling system, which means your entertainment will not be disturbed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X1WUK5wKL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R.W.FLAME","source_asin":"B0922DRRZB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0922DRRZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0922DRRZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
