window.products.push({"id":84497,"name":"Reusable Coffee Capsules for Bosch Tassimo Machine Refillable Coffee Capsule Pods Cups with Slicone Lid Coffee Filter Refillable with Readable Barcode","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YqWdxFinS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REUSABLE COFFEE PODS: Reusable coffee Capsules you can DIY coffee and spend less money but enjoy more. It is more enviroment than those One-time. This coffee filter help make your coffee more tastier, more professional and to a higher standard. This preserves the original taste of the beans and allows you to flow out mild coffee. COMPATIBLE TASSIMO: As the pod is the same size as the ones you buy in the shops and the barcode is readable. Such as compatible with Tassimo T20, Tassimo Vivy2, Tassimo T55+ CTPM05UC, CTPM12, tassimo vivy 2 ,CTPM07,CTPM02 ,CTPM08,Tassimo Tas4013 / 09 and etc. PRODUCT MATERIAL: Food-grade silicone soft cover to prevent contusion on the needle of the coffee machine. The inner net can be detached, the sealing of the lid is strengthened, and it is easier to clean. The food-grade PP cup body is safe and harmless, and the concave design at the bottom can effectively fix the capsule and prevent it from moving. All filters are 304 stainless steel filters are harmless to health. EASY TO USE: Fill with ground coffee up to the limit indicated, put on the lid fitted with the filter (be careful to put it in the right direction, point outwards) Press delicately all around the circle to fix the orange lid, especially not in the middle, otherwise the filter comes off. Then put this pod in its intended location. Enjoy a cup of fragrant coffee. NOTE: Make sure the coffee grinds do not exceed the maximum mark and do no press it tightly. Please clean thecoffee capsules in time after use, otherwise the coffee in the coffee capsules may crystallize after evaporating and solidify in the gaps of the pods, thereby blocking the capsules, and the water will not flow smoothly the second time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YqWdxFinS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOTSEK","source_asin":"B093FQ3BMW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093FQ3BMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B093FQ3BMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
