window.products.push({"id":84584,"name":"Sanivery Electric Portable Dryer for Clothes - Mini Clothes Dryer with Shoe Drying Attachment, Foldable Drying Rack, Super-Quiet Motor, Timers Automat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OlnNgkUZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Portable Dryer You’ve Always Wanted Ever wished there was a way you could dry swimsuits before checking out of the hotel? Dry laundry in your RV or van as you hit the open road? Efficiently dry clothes at home without having to splurge on a pricey machine? Congratulations, your wish has just come true! Meet the Sanivery portable dryer for clothes - a laundry essential that goes anywhere. Hang your clothes, plug it in, and get them nice & dry in the most compact of spaces. This 120V mini dryer for clothes features 3 settings to handle everything from swimsuits, underwear, shirts, to towels. We’ve even included shoe attachments. So, you’ll have the power to dry footwear in no time. Product Specifications: Color: White Voltage: 120V Host Weight: 1.3 Pounds / 0.6kg Host Size: L × W × H = 3.3 × 3.3 × 10.4 Inches / 8.5 × 8.5 × 26.5 cm Package Weight: 2.4 Pounds / 1.1 kg Package Dimensions: 7.01 x 3.94 x 11.7 Inches / 17.8 x 10 x 28 x cm Package Inclusions: 1 x Host 1 x Storage Bag 4 x Clothespins 1 x Small Drying Bag 1 x Large Drying Bag 1 x Shoe Drying Attachment Discover the Sanivery Difference The last thing you want is waking everyone up in your place. That’s why we’ve designed our small clothes dryer with an impressively quiet motor. So, unlike others that cause a racket, ours gets the job done without compromising your peace. And the Sanivery portable electric dryer stands out with something others just don’t have: a fold out drying rack that extends from 6.7” to 7.9”. This means power to dry multiple clothes at once or handle small child, baby, and pet clothes with ease. To ensure your clothes come out cleaner and fresher, we’ve included an essential oil compartment at the back","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OlnNgkUZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sanivery","source_asin":"B09YTQ9215","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YTQ9215","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YTQ9215","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
