window.products.push({"id":84730,"name":"Cenipar 338906 & 279834 &3392519 Gas Dryer Flame Sensor Valve Solenoid Coil Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pWA0jKtHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part Name: Cenipar 338906 Gas dryer flame sensor & 279834 Dryer Gas Valve Solenoid Coil Kit& 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse. What it is: The 338906 gas dryer flame sensor monitors whether the igniter is hot enough to ignite the gas to ignite the burner. 279834 dryer coil kit for gas valve. Includes two new gas coils. One coil is the main coil and one is the safety coil. If a coil stops working, it should be replaced in pairs.3392519 dryer non resettable thermal fuse, two 3/16\" wire terminals. For 338906&3392519:The sensor is located opposite the gas igniter of the dryer burner assembly. The flame sensor should be closed to ensure continuity at room temperature. Before replacement, check the continuity with a multimeter.If the dryer overheats, the thermal fuse blows to cut off power to the dryer and/or stop the dryer from running. For 279834:The solenoid valve group of the gas burner valve of the dryer. If the dryer does not heat or heats intermittently, the coil may be faulty. To test, observe the burner. If the igniter emits light for a period of time and then turns off without gas ignition, it usually means that one of the coils is damaged. Why choose us:We will stictly carry out the quality-control project,which will enable our customers to buy with confidence and use with satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pWA0jKtHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cenipar","source_asin":"B09DSTW3N8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSTW3N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSTW3N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":84731,"name":"Japanese Ceramic Coffee Dripper & Reusable Filter, Arita Porcelain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cW27Sb2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern and eco-friendly, this set includes a ceramic coffee dripper and reusable filter. The filter is filled with countless fine pores that effectively separate all solid materials and impurities from your beverage. Aside from coffee, it can be used for tea, drinking water, or Japanese alcohol such as shochu. Enhances the taste of coffee or tea beverages due to the far-infrared effect that is unique to ceramic products. To clean the filter after each use, remove the used coffee grounds and wash it with water until the water comes out clear. Do not use dish washing soap or detergent. Dimensions : 4.3 x 5.11 x 2.8 in (Dripper), 4.2 x 4.2 x 2.2 in (Filter) - Made in Arita, Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cW27Sb2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPPINKA","source_asin":"B08C8MJKRT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C8MJKRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C8MJKRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
