window.products.push({"id":84740,"name":"Merax 3.2 Cu.Ft. Compact Refrigerator, Mini Fridge with Freezer, Reversible Door, 5 Settings, Single Door Refrigerator for Kitchen, Dorm, Apartment, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715WI+vCbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Cooling for Fresh Storage - This freestanding fridge with freezer compartment has all the basic functions you need. The freezer compartment keeps your food chilled or frozen between -2℉ to 18℉, while the fridge compartment keeps meats succulent and leafy greens fresh between 26℉ to 42.8℉. The crisper drawer stores fruits and vegetables in the optimum conditions with high humidity and constant temperature to keep them fresh and juicy. 5 Temperature Settings - Although compact in size, Merax fridge offers both fridge and freezer compartment with 3.2 Cu.Ft. capacity. The thermostat control allows you dial the temperature between -2℉ to 42℉, offering you plenty of flexibility in storage options that adapts to various family needs. Superior Energy Efficiency - The freestanding fridge consumes as little as 0.56KWH of electricity per day, which costs only 0.07$ daily. It keeps your energy bill low while delivering a low-carbon lifestyle. Whisper quiet working sound ≤36dB allows the refrigerator to be placed closer to the point of care, reducing unnecessary foot traffic to and from centralized cold storage equipment. Smart Design - Merax single door mini refrigerator features a stylish design with smooth surfaces for sophisticated look, that makes it a seamless addition to any kitchen, apartment, dorm, hotel or RV. The Interchangeable door hinge and adjustable leveling leg provide the fridge more flexibility in placing locations, and the various door balconies provides plenty of space for all your chilled favorites. Compact Size, Large Capacity - Merax compact fridge measures 18.5” x 17.32” x 32.48”, a space-saving design leaves more room for groceries. It’s important to keep the fridge unplugged and UPRIGHT for 24 hours before using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715WI+vCbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merax","source_asin":"B094YJTWWT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094YJTWWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B094YJTWWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
