window.products.push({"id":84767,"name":"137221600 Frigidaire Washing Machine Water Pump 137221600 Askoll M65 134051200 Electrolux Drain Washer Replacement Part AP5684706 PS7783938 FEX831FS4 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wmn85woQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Frigidaire Drain Pump 137221600 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5684706, 131724000, 134051200, 134740500, 137108100, 137151800, 137151800KITK, 2754548, ER137108100, PS7783938, TJ137108100. Washing Machine Pump 137221600 is compatible with Frigidaire, Crosley, Electrolux, Gibson, Kenmore, Uni, Westinghouse. 137221600 Pump is a crucial component that helps to pump water out of the washer during the spin cycle. Includes a flapper to prevent drain backflow. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Electrolux Washer Parts 137221600? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Frigidaire Washer Drain Pump 137221600 will help if your appliance does not drain, is noisy, pumps but does not spin, or is leaking. 137221600 Drain Pump fits hundreds of models, so it's important to check your washing machine model number to ensure the compatibility. 💡 137221600 Frigidaire Washer Drain Pump is responsible for draining the water from the tub and sending it down the drain hose to exit the machine. If the water pump is not functioning correctly, your washing machine may not be able to complete a cycle or may leave your clothes soaking wet at the end of the cycle. 137221600 Washer Drain Pump Replacement meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 The 137221600 Drain Pump Replacement is typically located at the bottom of the washing machine, and it is connected to the motor with two screws. To ensure that your Frigidaire Washer Pump 137221600 continues to operate correctly, it's essential to perform regular maintenance. This includes cleaning the pump filter regularly, checking for blockages in the pump or drain hose, and ensuring that the 137221600 Washer Drain Pump is securely attached to the motor. 💡 How long can the Water Pump 137221600 last with proper maintenance? The lifespan of a Frigidaire Washer Pump 137221600 can vary depending on various factors such as usage frequency, environmental conditions, and maintenance practices. However, with proper maintenance, the water pump can last for several years. It's important to regularly clean your water pump and its parts, check for signs of wear or damage, and promptly replace any worn or damaged parts to ensure the longevity of the pump.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wmn85woQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07MJ8R11L","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJ8R11L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJ8R11L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
