window.products.push({"id":84786,"name":"Ice Maker 265lbs/24H Commercial Ice Machine, 120 Cubes per Batch in 13-20 Minutes with 48lbs Storage Bin, Advanced LCD Panel with Clear Indicators,Fre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1099.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VtB1qOFhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Larger Storage】Do you think the general ice maker is not enough to meet your needs of ice? 265 lbs daily ice output of satisfies you with high demands of ice, being able to make 1000 cups of ice drinks per day(approximately). Our commercial ice maker produce 120 ice cube per batch, being more times than the ice prepared by general daily ice maker.48 lbs ice storage allows you to enjoy adequate ice when you need. ❄【Automatic Cleaning and Blue Light Function】 Do you concern about the cleaning? The ice maker help you to solve this issue by automatic cleaning function. It is only needed to be operate on smart panel( Operation induction can be found in User Manual).Besides, our inside blue light improves the maintain time of ice, slowing down the speed of ice melting. ❄【Efficient and Flexible】Ice cubes overall is ready in 13-20 minutes per batch. The less thickness of ice is, the faster ice making time does, and vice versa. Compare with specific ice time, our commercial ice maker is more flexible since the ice process duration can be adjusted randomly by the “+”and “-” button.You can change the ice making time according to your preference. ❄【Smart Operation with Advanced Panel】 Super advanced panel with clear LCD indicators allows multiple operations. You can choose different functions by touching the button on the below of panel and see the working status via indicators on the upper of panel. Besides, our commercial ice maker has timer to set up delayed time for power on/off. Easy operation with detailed indicators allows you to enjoy your ice time intelligently. ❄【Powerful and Safe for Commercial Use】 With 21.9 x 17.1 x 31.7 inches and weight of 90.4 pounds, FREE VILLAGE commercial ice maker equips with strong 750W compressor, providing powerful capacity of intensive operation for more than daily use. Meanwhile, the ice maker is durable and safe because of its body’s three-layer materials which is include food-grade ABS,thermal insulation and solid stainless cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VtB1qOFhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREE VILLAGE","source_asin":"B09Y5LGB2F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5LGB2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5LGB2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
