window.products.push({"id":84801,"name":"LG EBR68349111 Genuine OEM Main Control Board for LG Air Conditioners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DYRpYIgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This high quality Genuine OEM LG Main Control Board (EBR68349111) is a PCBA (Printed Circuit Board Assembly) that manages the functions of the dishwasher such as tempurature and fan control. The Main Control Board Is also called the Main PCB (Power Contrl Board) Assembly and is mounted in a plastic case. Life's Good when choosing Genuine LG OEM Factory parts for your LG appliances. This part is often misdiagnosed and requires electrical testing with a volt/ohm meter to determine if it is defective. Please be aware that it is recommended to disconnect the appliance from all utilities prior to installation of the Main Control Board.LG Air Conditioner Models Compatible with the LG EBR68349111 Main Control Board: LMU369HV, MR36TQY3JM","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DYRpYIgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B00LKOXXWW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LKOXXWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LKOXXWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
