window.products.push({"id":84895,"name":"Kismile Commercial Ice Maker, Freestanding Square Ice Cube Maker 265lbs/24h, 55lbs Storage Bin, Full Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Construction, Ice Make","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNoG2BrhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fast & Efficient Ice Making】Featuring a powerful compressor, the Kismile commercial ice maker can produce 265 lbs of ice per day (48 clear ice cubes for one cycle in just 12 to 18 minutes), and comes with a storage container for 55 lbs of ice. Therefore, the nugget ice maker definitely will meet your daily needs for whole family. 【Easy Operated Ice Maker】The ice maker machine built with a LCD control panel, which features on/off, auto clean, and time setting functions. Besides, If the ice machine is running continuously, it will cut itself off when filled with ice. Then it will turn itself back on as needed to replace any melting ice and keep itself full. 【Heavy-duty & Compact Construction】This ice machine is made of powder-coating stainless steel, which ensures the sturdiness for long term use. Besides, designed with compact structural feature(21.9\"x17.1\"x32.8\"), Kismile ice machine allows you to install anywhere. Note:The drain is gravity fed so your drain system must be BELOW the drain line (located just a few inches above the bottom of the machine). 【Adjustable Ice Cube Thickness】If you worry about the ice cubes being melting very quickly, then our Kismile commercial ice maker is the way to go. There are different thicknesses of ice can be made by adjusting the time of the ice-making. But if you'd like to keep ice cubes for a long time, you'd better keep them in the freezer. 【Wide Range of Applications】The machine produces crystal clear ice cubes that work great for applications in home bar, restaurants, bars, hotels, grocery stores and more(not for outdoor use). Combining sleek finish and practical functions, our ice maker will be your ideal choice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNoG2BrhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kismile","source_asin":"B088BH2HNQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-84895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088BH2HNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088BH2HNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
